# --- Private working documents (owner decision 2026-10-25) ---
# The public repo keeps only durable, user/contributor-facing docs. Dated
# interim working documents - expert reviews, external-review briefs, coder
# kickoff briefs, milestone plans and handovers - live in the private
# Apple-II-harness repo (pocket_docs/) and stay on disk here so local
# cross-references keep working.
#
# Rule: a date in the filename marks it interim. Undated files are durable and
# are tracked normally, so add new permanent documentation WITHOUT a date.
#
# Currently public and durable:
#   README.md, AGENTS.md
#   docs/HARDWARE_CAPTURE_CHECKLIST.md
#   docs/OSK_KEYBOARD_FLOOD.md
#   docs/POCKET_BOOT_HARNESS.md
docs/*_20[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9].md
docs/recommendation.md
REVIEW_RECOMMENDATIONS_*.md

# Quartus run logs from this worktree (generated, not source)
src/fpga/*.log

# Verilator harness build logs (generated)
verilog/obj_dir_*/*.log
verilog/obj_dir_*.log
